      "title": "Fixing My Employee’s House For a Day - The Setup Doctor (SPONSORED)",
      "text": "<p>Click the link below to get an extra 6% off your Vernal desk.</p><p><br /></p><p>US: <a href=\"https://bit.ly/4vOLHBs\">https://bit.ly/4vOLHBs</a></p><p>UK: <a href=\"https://bit.ly/4ddpANO\">https://bit.ly/4ddpANO</a></p><p>DE: <a href=\"https://bit.ly/42zuYEP\">https://bit.ly/42zuYEP</a></p><p><br /></p><p>LTT production hero Reece's setup is suffering from terrible cable management and a crappy desk. The Setup Doctor is in! We transformed his chaotic gaming and streaming space, shoe room and more - upgrading him with the sturdy Vernal Core3 L-shaped Standing Desk and custom accessories. Plus, we check out his unique hobby.</p>",
